From: Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: map EN7581 optical GDM2 source port

Return SPORT2 for EN7581 GDM2 NBQ0. This lets the optical CPU probe
validate its WAN receiver and lets QDMA migration close the optical
classifier through the existing source-port change guard. Reject all
other GDM2 NBQs and preserve the GDM3 and GDM4 mappings.

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -5175,6 +5175,10 @@
 static int airoha_en7581_get_sport(struct airoha_gdm_port *port, int nbq)
 {
 	switch (port->id) {
+	case AIROHA_GDM2_IDX:
+		if (!nbq)
+			return 2;
+		break;
 	case AIROHA_GDM3_IDX:
 		/* 7581 SoC supports PCIe serdes on GDM3 port */
 		if (nbq == 4)
